Title: F2-M03 — The Last Ferry (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

LIEUTENANT PETROV
(serious)
The ferry has families aboard and a crew that refused to abandon them. Enemy scouts are closing on the shore.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

COMMANDER SAVA
(measured)
We have one transport and a small escort. There is no time to bring the full column around the lake.

LENKA
(firm)
Open the shoreline route, repair the ferry engine, and escort everyone to the evacuation point.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
